      "text": "those who are ashamed fall away into forbidden paths, 1 Ne. 8:28. Nephi1 is forbidden to write remainder of what he saw, 1 Ne. 14:28. none are forbidden to partake of God’s goodness, 2 Ne. 26:28. ye shall not forbid any man from coming into meeting, 3 Ne. 18:22. forbid unworthy from partaking sacrament, 3 Ne. 18:29 (4 Ne. 1:27). Christ forbids Nephi3 to write all things from plates of Nephi, 3 Ne. 26:11. men are forbidden to write all of marvelous things uttered or heard, 3 Ne. 26:16 (27:23; 28:14). the Lord forbids Mormon2 to write names of three who would never taste death, 3 Ne. 28:25. Mormon2 is forbidden to preach unto people, Morm. 1:16–17. things written by brother of Jared2 were forbidden to come unto men until after Crucifixion, Ether 4:1. to translate sealed things is forbidden, Ether 5:1. God has forbidden that men work in secret combinations, Ether 8:18–19. Moroni2 is forbidden to write more of Ether’s prophecies, Ether 13:13.",
